Table full name: bigquery-public-data.iowa_liquor_sales.sales
Column name: invoice_and_item_number Type: STRING Description: Concatenated invoice and line number associated with the liquor order. This provides a unique identifier for the individual liquor products included in the store order.
Column name: date Type: DATE Description: Date of order
Column name: store_number Type: STRING Description: Unique number assigned to the store who ordered the liquor.
Column name: store_name Type: STRING Description: Name of store who ordered the liquor.
Column name: address Type: STRING Description: Address of store who ordered the liquor.
Column name: city Type: STRING Description: City where the store who ordered the liquor is located
Column name: zip_code Type: STRING Description: Zip code where the store who ordered the liquor is located
Column name: store_location Type: GEOGRAPHY Description: Location of store who ordered the liquor. The Address, City, State and Zip Code are geocoded to provide geographic coordinates. Accuracy of geocoding is dependent on how well the address is interpreted and the completeness of the reference data used.
Column name: county_number Type: STRING Description: Iowa county number for the county where store who ordered the liquor is located
Column name: county Type: STRING Description: County where the store who ordered the liquor is located
Column name: category Type: STRING Description: Category code associated with the liquor ordered
Column name: category_name Type: STRING Description: Category of the liquor ordered.
Column name: vendor_number Type: STRING Description: The vendor number of the company for the brand of liquor ordered
Column name: vendor_name Type: STRING Description: The vendor name of the company for the brand of liquor ordered
Column name: item_number Type: STRING Description: Item number for the individual liquor product ordered.
Column name: item_description Type: STRING Description: Description of the individual liquor product ordered.
Column name: pack Type: INT64 Description: The number of bottles in a case for the liquor ordered
